</section>

<!-- ABOUT -->
<section id="about" class="about-section">
  <div class="about-inner">
    <div class="about-photo reveal-left">
      <img src="assets/images/gallery-08-action-waves-banner.jpg" alt="Dominican All Star barbers at work in Marietta GA"/>
    </div>
    <div class="about-text reveal-right">
      <p class="label" data-t="ab-lbl">Marietta's Go-To Barbershop</p>
      <h2 data-t="ab-ttl">More Than a Cut — It's a Culture</h2>
      <p data-t="ab-p1">Walk in and you feel it immediately — the Latin music, the energy, the smell of fresh product. Dominican All Star has been the go-to spot for anyone in the Atlanta area who refuses to settle for a bad cut. No appointments. No waiting weeks. Just show up.</p>
      <p data-t="ab-p2">Founded by Adrian, a master barber with natural talent behind every cut, the shop has grown into a full team — Juan, Kelvin, Felipe, Suerto, Noel and more. Every service finishes with a hot towel. That's standard here, not an upgrade. And right next door at Suite B, Glam Dominican Salon brings the same energy to full hair care.</p>
      <div class="about-pull">
        <p data-t="ab-q">"Best barbers in Atlanta. For years I searched and could not find a decent barber. Adrian and crew are the best — the 36-mile drive is always worth it. Natural talent is what sets them apart."</p>
        <cite data-t="ab-c">— Google Review · ★★★★★</cite>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- GALLERY -->
<section id="gallery" class="gallery-section">
  <div class="section-head reveal">
    <p class="label" data-t="g-lbl">The Work</p>
    <h2 data-t="g-ttl">FRESH CUTS ONLY</h2>
  </div>

  <!--
