    'ab-p2':'Founded by Adrian, a master barber with natural talent behind every cut, the shop has grown into a full team — Juan, Kelvin, Felipe, Suerto, Noel and more. Every service finishes with a hot towel. That\'s standard here, not an upgrade. And right next door at Suite B, Glam Dominican Salon brings the same energy to full hair care.',
    'ab-q':'"Best barbers in Atlanta. For years I searched and could not find a decent barber. Adrian and crew are the best — the 36-mile drive is always worth it. Natural talent is what sets them apart."',
    'ab-c':'— Google Review · ★★★★★',
